{"2067070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ragtag Heroes : CO-OP Deckbuilder", "steam_appid": 2067070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The world's champion is dead. Guess it's your problem now.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ragtag Heroes is a co-op roguelike deckbuilder for 1-3 players where co-op isn't a mode - it's the whole design. The real magic happens between your decks, not just inside them. Combine your heroes' abilities, set up devastating team combos, and watch your perfect plan come together - or fall apart in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD DECKS THAT COMBO</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/46cddf4d7f6b1ab72830e0f60e5b8f82.poster.avif?t=1777538352\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/46cddf4d7f6b1ab72830e0f60e5b8f82.webm?t=1777538352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/46cddf4d7f6b1ab72830e0f60e5b8f82.mp4?t=1777538352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every hero has their own cards, relics, and playstyle - but the best moments happen when they collide. One hero locks an enemy in place while another unloads everything they've got. Swap teammates between runs to discover entirely new strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CONTROL THE BATTLEFIELD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/ec269e8e0e8c5fb2c4364d4c3b0d10c5.poster.avif?t=1777538352\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/ec269e8e0e8c5fb2c4364d4c3b0d10c5.webm?t=1777538352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/ec269e8e0e8c5fb2c4364d4c3b0d10c5.mp4?t=1777538352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't just a card game - positioning matters. Shove monsters away from your weakest hero. Drag enemies into range of your hardest hitter. Lock them in place or punish them for moving - but watch out, they'll try the same on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CONTROL THE TURNORDER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/60b9f4d15a1e66bdce189fdecf632e79.poster.avif?t=1777538352\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/60b9f4d15a1e66bdce189fdecf632e79.webm?t=1777538352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/60b9f4d15a1e66bdce189fdecf632e79.mp4?t=1777538352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drain an enemy's initiative to zero and watch them stand there, helpless, while your team piles on. Strategically slow down the most dangerous enemies so your heroes act first — or concentrate your efforts to stun them entirely and skip their turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RUNS THAT FORCE YOU TO ADAPT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/9c6540793d39bddb2421ea9348fe5d0f.poster.avif?t=1777538352\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/9c6540793d39bddb2421ea9348fe5d0f.webm?t=1777538352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/9c6540793d39bddb2421ea9348fe5d0f.mp4?t=1777538352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Worlds shuffle every run, and corruption deepens the further you go, twisting familiar stages into something nastier. The strategy that worked last time might completely fall apart this time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BRAVE OR DEFAULT - RISK NOW OR SCALE LATER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/daeb611d10d5982f11a45b104f38a60e.poster.avif?t=1777538352\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/daeb611d10d5982f11a45b104f38a60e.webm?t=1777538352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/daeb611d10d5982f11a45b104f38a60e.mp4?t=1777538352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push your luck with Brave for extra actions now - and spend next turn stunned. Or Default to bank energy for a bigger play later. A simple choice that constantly makes you wonder: should we actually do this?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WHAT'S IN THE GAME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 7+ heroes with their own set of cards and relics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >500+ different cards  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >300+ combat encounters and 60+ story events</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5+ worlds with multiple corruption stages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op for up to 3 players</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EARLY ACCESS </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Jump in at a lower price while we're still building. Play it now, help shape it as it grows.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/e217f13fbe5a4c1ab6db17e9f134c1ce.avif?t=1777538352\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The world's champion is dead. Guess it's your problem now.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ragtag Heroes is a co-op roguelike deckbuilder for 1-3 players where co-op isn't a mode - it's the whole design. The real magic happens between your decks, not just inside them. Combine your heroes' abilities, set up devastating team combos, and watch your perfect plan come together - or fall apart in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD DECKS THAT COMBO</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_